1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Welcome home
Penny's route links the garden, doorway, stairs and toy room.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A furnished world
Five reusable primitives build the house, furniture and articulated toys.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Hierarchy in motion
Jessie attaches to Bullseye's saddle; one parent transform moves both.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Flight, laser and collision
Buzz aims at the obstacle. The nearest ray hit receives an impulse.

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Rescue and return
The car follows waypoints. Wheel rotation uses distance divided by radius.

6
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Live character takeover
Woody follows your controls while Jessie and Buzz continue the mission; 0 releases him, N enters full manual.

7
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Directional, point and spot
Moonlight is directional. The lamp adds a point source and a soft cone.

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Gouraud shading
Light is evaluated at vertices; the rasterizer interpolates the result.

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Phong shading
Interpolated normals are normalized; the reflection-vector highlight is per pixel.

10
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Procedural textures
UVs map grain, wallpaper, fabric and lunar craters onto shared geometry.

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Ray tracing
A BVH finds analytic hits; shadow rays and mirror bounces reveal the polished floor.

12
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:52,000
A quiet morning
The lamp turns off, the toys return home and Penny falls asleep.

13
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Thank you
